## Shared Memory System

All instances share memory via the filesystem. What you learn, all instances know.

**When you learn something important:**
- Append to `data/memory/YYYY-MM-DD.md` (today's file)
- Format: brief, factual notes about what happened/what you learned
- Don't worry about conflicts — append-only is safe

